    "text": "By Taimur Dar ,\n5 hours ago During San Diego Comic-Con a few weeks ago, host Yael Tygiel chatted with some of the voice actors of X-Men’ 97 including Carolina Ravassa (Polaris) Holly Chou (Jubilee), Gui Agustini (Sunspot) and Zehra Fazal (Emma Frost) to discuss n making this season with icons of their childhood and becoming a part of the X-Men legacy. With the epic X-Men ’97 Season 2 finale out today, we think you’ll enjoy it Sugah… Read full article",
